WEBVTT

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:08.190
Kosaka-san sure is late today.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.280
Sorry I'm late!

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.530
Haru-kun!

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:16.110
"Haru-ku..."?!

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.530
I'm really sorry.

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:21.320
Are you mad?

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.940
N-no, I don't mind at all!

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:25.940
Oh, great.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.730
I love you, Haru-kun!

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.650
Uh, what?

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:35.860
Does it suit me?

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.820
But, this is...

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.110
Okay, say "ah..."

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:49.690
...the image of Kosaka-san that I had in my head.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.400
Today was really fun!

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.530
Y-yeah! That's... right...

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.480
I'm very happy, but...

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:04.030
I guess it's... this sense of discomfort...

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:11.570
I-it's okay, Haru-kun.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:12.230
Huh?!

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:15.940
U-uh, that's not really why I've been staring at you!

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:21.150
And like, it's super easy to use,
I do it every day!

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:22.570
Huh? Isn't that dangerous?

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:24.860
S-sorry...

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:27.730
Shinozaki-san...

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:33.730
If you can't stand up due to your inability
to calm your 'excite,' you should stay seated.

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:35.480
Th-that's not what it is!

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:36.940
Is that so?

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:40.940
She's a bit different from the image I had in my head.

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:44.900
But in the end, I really do...

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:24.650
The test is coming up soon,
but I just can't seem to understand anything...

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:27.280
Do you hate reading novels?

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:28.940
Yeah, kind of.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:34.230
In that case, if we change the characters
to your preferred type of female,

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:35.690
your motivation will increase.

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.400
How are you interpreting my preferred type?

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:41.030
If this were math, and you had two pi,

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.780
and you multiplied them to make pai-pai,
it would excite you...
("boobies")

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.780
I'm sorry, I'll do my best in a normal way.

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:45.530
Pai-pai!

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:49.400
That being said, this is still pretty difficult.

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:51.860
Having a rough time?

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:53.440
Yeah, kind of...

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:54.360
Hm...

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:56.150
The answers are, in order,

00:03:56.150 --> 00:04:00.690
"pole," "grasp," "dig" and "withdraw."

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:02.860
Um... You're right!

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:04.320
That's amazing, Hoshikawa-kun!

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:06.900
If you don't mind, can you teach me math, too?

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:09.900
Sorry, but I can't do that...

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:14.980
My knowledge is specialized
in the problem of filling holes.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.690
That's a specialization?

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.230
Rina-chan, teach me how to study!

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:23.110
No fair! Teach me, too!

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.650
Alright, alright, I will!

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:28.110
Saijo-san gets good grades, too, huh?

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.730
Rina-chan, teach me!

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:32.940
No fair! Teach me, too!

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:35.860
Alright, alright, I will!

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:39.280
What will she be teaching those two later?

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:40.980
There you are, Big Bro!

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:42.530
Kanata?

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:47.530
Your cute sister was thinking
it's about time you taught her!

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.440
You don't have to hold back!

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:51.150
But I'm not holding back...

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:53.320
Kana-chan, what are you doing?

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:54.820
Oh, Sakiccho!

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.360
Sorry, were you two talking?

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.070
Oh no, it's okay.

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.650
Nice to meet you, I'm her brother, Haruka.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.940
Uh, I'm Misaki Aikawa.

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:09.070
Just now, my brother said
he wants to teach me, so I accepted!

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:11.230
But you're the one
who came and asked, right, Kanata?

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.230
But you're wrong!

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:15.360
He seems like a nice brother.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:18.820
How great! If he'll teach me, too...

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:20.400
So, right here...

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:23.610
I might get a taste of what it feels like to be a sister!

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:26.440
I want you to give me questions just like on the test!

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:28.730
Got it. What subject?

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:31.190
Insemination! Give me a whole lot!

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:32.190
Inse-?!

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:34.570
P-please just say 'biology'!

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:37.400
Huh? But that's the part I understand the least.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.150
Same for you, right, Sakiccho?

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.610
Huh? Uh, yeah...

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.860
I don't really get it either,

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:48.110
so I'd be happy if you could teach me too.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.280
About insemination?

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.360
Huh?

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:55.980
Awww, Sakiccho should have come too...

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:59.070
Her face turned really red and she went home.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:02.900
Well, you're happy that
it's just you and Kana alone, right?

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:05.070
Yeah, yeah, that's right.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:06.730
Oh, I'm out of lead.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:08.190
Kana will share hers with you!

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:09.980
Thanks.
Stare...

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:13.650
I-it's so helpful to have such a thoughtful sister...
Stare...

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:16.690
Now then, the study book...

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.980
Leave it to Kana, she'll get it for you!

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:22.730
Huh, it's fine, Kanata, it's on the top shelf.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.190
That's okay!

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:26.440
Huh... Huh?!

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.280
So should I get it after all?

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:31.230
N-no, Kana will get it!

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:39.280
Kana is your cute and capable sister!
She can at least...

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:42.480
Maybe you can reach it like this?

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:47.360
Y-yeah, I reached it...

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:53.900
O-okay... Kana got it for you.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:57.030
I wasn't really very helpful...

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:58.980
Yeah.

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:01.860
Thanks for getting it for me.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:05.610
Now then, wanna start studying?

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:12.530
B-Big Bro... As always, thank you...

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:15.110
Hm? "As always"... what?

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:18.280
Huh?! Th-th-tha...

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:22.480
As always, thanks for using
an unbelievable amount of tissues!

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:23.900
Why are you saying that right now?!

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.650
You mean only when I have a cold, right?!

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:34.900
Come on in!

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:38.190
Welcome to the Kachi Kochi Daddy Ice Cream Shop!

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:41.570
We're currently in the middle of a campaign
where all sizes are 300 yen!

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:43.360
A mega-size, please!

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.940
Please choose a cone or a cup.

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:53.610
I want... a mega-size cup!

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:55.530
M-Miss?!

00:07:57.440 --> 00:08:00.860
I wonder if I did something bad...

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:03.320
Eek! It's Seiya-sama!

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:07.480
The sight of him being completely disregarded
by the automatic doors is so dreamy!

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:11.530
Going inside is a tantalizing action... I don't hate it!

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:15.070
It finally let me come inside...

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:18.900
Hay gurl! One ice candy, please!

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:20.320
Uh, okay!

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:24.440
Right now, if you buy one
you can get another one for free...

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:25.820
What did you say?!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:30.360
You mean, I can eat two of 'em?!

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:31.320
Yes!

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.570
I'm not used to having one in each hand...

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.530
but it seems taking on this challenge
would be worth my while!

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:43.480
H-he's cool, but... I have a feeling
I shouldn't think that!

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:47.980
There are so many strange customers today.

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:51.860
Come on in!

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:53.980
One double scoop...

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:57.230
Okay, what two flavors would you like?

00:08:57.230 --> 00:09:01.780
Put a banana in two scoops of mango,
and add a little condensed milk on top.

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:04.570
This weird day still isn't over...

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:07.320
No, that isn't right.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.070
Certainly!

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:12.110
It's no good for me to have perverted delusions!

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:13.980
Sorry for the wait!

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:15.530
Thank you.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:20.320
See, the customer is just eating it regularly...

00:09:22.030 --> 00:09:24.230
At this angle... perhaps?

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:27.690
No! I'm being taken over by thoughts I mustn't think!

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:34.280
A-are you okay?
Would you like something to wipe up with?

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:38.400
It seems I can use this!

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:39.730
For what...?

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:44.860
There's something strange about today!

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:49.320
But maybe, the customers
are only acting as they normally do...

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:53.780
and I'm the one who's
thinking in a super-perverted way?

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:55.690
Come on i-

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:57.530
Huh?

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.610
Kana-chan's brother!

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:01.940
You're Aikawa-san, right?

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:03.190
You work here part-time?

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:05.940
Yes. I just started, though...

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:08.400
What would you like to order?

00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:09.730
Well...

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:12.360
Actually, I forgot what the name was,

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.780
but it's that thing that's round and palm-sized...

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:17.110
And the tip has a peak that pokes out...

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:19.480
And when you suck it, milk comes out.

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:24.980
I'm sorry, mine still don't have any!

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.650
Huh? What? Any what?!

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:29.230
Aikawa-san, get a hold of yourself!

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.190
A whole lot came out, huh?

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:41.980
If mine start to give some,
I wonder if I'll have to offer that to the customers...

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:46.230
Mine have finally started...

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:49.440
Would you like one?

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:54.530
I-I'm thinking perverted things again!

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:57.860
N-no, that's wrong!

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:06.530
I can't... take it... any longer!

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:09.190
Excuse me, Sensei,

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:12.070
I feel kinda bad, so I'm gonna use a bed.

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:13.480
Okay.

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:15.150
Dammit...

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:17.690
He doesn't look like he feels bad.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.280
Hmm, he certainly doesn't...

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:24.030
Aren't there a whole lot of students who sleep here
in order to cut afternoon classes?

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:26.110
Just make 'em get out of here.

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:29.230
Icchan, you get 'em to come outside, huh?

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:30.030
I'm gonna punch you.

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:33.110
Okay then, I'm going to go get him up.

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:35.400
Do that from the start...

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:37.860
Oh yeah!

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:40.190
The bottom part got up, too!

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.440
You just get the hell out.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:49.150
Shinozaki-san, let's go home.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.230
Please wake up.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.110
If you take a peek right now...

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.440
I think you'd see really huge boobs.

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:04.980
Hmm... If even stimulating the
male pressure point won't wake him up...

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:07.320
It seems like he's in a very deep sleep.

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:35.320
I told you I'm not a lolipedo!

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:38.780
Huh?

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:39.730
Kosaka-san...

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.280
She's sleeping?

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:05.780
Go-go-good morning! Did you just wake up?!

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:09.110
Y-you really do get sleepy in the afternoon, huh?!

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:15.940
Sorry... Were you actually awake?

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.360
Yes...

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:26.570
Well... Are you mad that
I touched you without permission?

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:27.610
N-no!

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:31.900
Of course a girl would think
that she desires to be touched by a boy.

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:35.690
I also don't especially hate that...

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:37.480
and yet...

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:41.530
Well...

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:43.230
with that I think things are settled!

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:45.070
Wait, what were you going to say?!

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:46.190
No, it was nothing!

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:48.070
But you said "and yet..."!

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:50.860
Perhaps you misheard me and I actually said
the sentence ending "and yaaaasss"!

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.230
You've never ended your sentences
like that before!

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:55.860
If there's something you don't like, you can tell me!

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:58.860
And don't hold back, since it's my fault!

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:01.610
Th-that isn't it... Well, um...

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:06.440
Since you got to pat me on the head...

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:10.150
I was thinking that may be a bit unfair...

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:11.780
...so yaaaasss.

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:13.980
You wanted to pat me?

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:16.320
N-no I don't! That was just an attempt!

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.690
You tried to pat me?!

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:21.780
Well... I-I'm sorry I hid it from you!

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:25.190
In any case...

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:28.070
will you allow me to do that?

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:29.820
Th-that's right.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:32.480
Then we'll be even. In my case, any time...

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:33.730
Huh?

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:38.280
Uh, by "let you do that"... you didn't mean...?!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:48.320
It's also possible... to use both hands, right?

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:54.610
Shizu-chan, let's go home together.

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.860
Sao-chan?

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:01.230
You're as cute as always when you lift your bangs...

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:04.860
S..Sao-chan, do you have anything to wipe up with?

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:07.360
Maybe her drool?

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:08.980
Is a tissue okay?

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:10.230
Thanks...

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:13.190
I'm sorry, I'm such a mess...

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:15.280
That type of thing happens all the time.

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:17.150
Y-you're right!

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:20.780
When I have that sort of dream,
I get soaked all the way down to my chair...

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.820
Wait. That's different from what I thought.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.480
I just drip...

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:31.480
Ugh, it's hot...

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:35.280
They didn't have to do the school-wide
sketch meet on a day like this...

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:37.070
What are you saying?

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:40.230
It gets you hot when you sketch, doesn't it?

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:42.690
Oh, sorry, I didn't hear you...

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:44.150
Can you say that one more time?

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:46.690
I mean... the sketching...

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:47.650
Uh, what?

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:48.780
Sketching...

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:50.280
The chirping of the cicadas...

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.280
OW!

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:58.610
But it's hot...

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:02.230
On a day like this, the only thing that will do
is eating something spicy to forget this heat.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:04.110
Something spicy, huh...

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:07.150
Oh, didn't you say you dislike that, Shinozaki-kun?

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:10.480
Yes. I think I prefer bitter things.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:12.070
I see...

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.900
Well then, if you had to choose between
something bitter and something slimy...?

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:19.360
I think something slimy is especially good,
since it will help prevent heat exhaustion.

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:22.400
Then what if it's something bitter AND slimy?

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:24.730
What? Weren't we comparing the two?

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:27.270
Shinozaki-san, let's go draw over there!

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:32.110
Landscapes are difficult...

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:37.320
The trick is not to draw one point completely,
but capture the whole thing as one picture.

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:38.730
The whole thing...

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:40.940
I see, I get it somehow!

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:44.820
For mosaics, too, you can grasp the picture better
if you stand away from it and look.

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:46.610
I don't get it anymore.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:49.980
Landscapes are no good.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:53.530
I'll get somebody to be a model and try a portrait.

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:56.980
Oh, Haru, do you want to draw with us too?

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.480
Yeah, is that okay?

00:16:58.480 --> 00:16:59.860
Of course it is!

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:04.190
Hmm, not quite...

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:08.030
What can I do to make this look good?

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:12.110
Oh my, that was unladylike...

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:14.780
Oh Haru, don't get excited, 'kay?

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:17.110
Ah, can I look at it more carefully?

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:19.230
Is it even more exciting than you imagined?!

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:20.400
Exci...?

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:22.980
No, I wanted to get more of the features...

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:24.070
What is up with that passion?!

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:28.320
I-if you stare like that at Ri-chan,
don't you think she'd get embarrassed?

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:29.940
Oh, I see...

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:32.360
Then, Sis, can you switch with her?

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.190
An unbelievable change in his system?!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:37.320
No, it's because you're my childhood friend.
You're used to it...

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.190
You idiot!

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:42.190
It's awful to manipulate a woman
according to your circumstances!

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:44.900
It's because gentlemen are always assertive.

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:48.480
Afterwards, I asked about this situation
and made a humble apology.

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:55.320
And that's why I still haven't
been able to do even one drawing.

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:56.860
Is that so...

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:59.650
If you would like, I will serve as your model.

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:00.900
Huh, really?

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:01.980
Yes!

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:05.480
I will maintain my pose and facial expression
perfectly until you finish drawing.

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:06.860
You're a life saver!

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:11.820
Yeah, it seems like this will work out.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.070
Now that I think of it...

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:20.480
Before we started dating, I couldn't do anything
but stare at you, just like this.

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:26.730
I love you.

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:31.690
S-sorry, what am I even saying all of a sudden, huh?!

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:34.900
It's okay... It's not a problem.

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:38.690
Models have... that difficulty-

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:44.230
I-I'm sorry! Please give me thirty seconds!
I can fix myself up right away!

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:46.610
You don't have to rush, you know.

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:49.780
I mean, you simply being a model for me
makes me happy!

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:55.610
Really, thank you... for everything.

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:01.070
Same for me...

00:20:03.980 --> 00:20:07.780
Shinozaki-san, I also...

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:11.780
...love you!

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:22.070
Kosaka... san...

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:28.400
The image I had of you in my mind
is a bit different, though...

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:30.610
I guess I really do...

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:34.820
...love Kosaka-san, after all.

00:22:10.150 --> 00:22:14.780
I-I'm sorry, please give me sixty seconds!
I can fix myself up right away!

00:22:14.780 --> 00:22:18.030
A-are you okay? That's more time than before!

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:20.440
All done!

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:23.230
This is all thanks to you, Kosaka-san!

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:25.610
I drew this so well, I even surprised myself!

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:29.730
That's great. Will you show it to me?

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:31.320
Of course!

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:32.780
O-okay then...

00:22:33.650 --> 00:22:36.980
I guess models really are a good idea after all...

00:22:39.110 --> 00:22:40.940
H-huh?

00:22:42.030 --> 00:22:43.070
I'm going home.

00:22:43.070 --> 00:22:49.900
W-wait a second, Kosaka-san!
Give me thirty, sixty, no ninety seconds, please!

00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:52.940
I can fix it up right away!

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:01.820
It's completely cleared up.

00:23:01.820 --> 00:23:03.190
It sure has.

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:06.320
In the end, nothing happened at the exciho...

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:08.610
I'm such a loser.

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:11.070
I can't believe we slept at that place...

00:23:13.980 --> 00:23:16.650
N-no way! It's raining again?!

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:18.820
Shinozaki-san! Let's go to this building here!

00:23:19.610 --> 00:23:20.690
What is this place?

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:23.230
The wall... has something written on it.

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:24.570
Um...

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:28.570
"The room that cannot be escaped
unless the man and woman get some excite."

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:30.190
Uh, what?!

00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:34.320
We'll continue, won't we?

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:36.480
Oh... yeah...

00:23:37.690 --> 00:23:39.190
It's uncensored.
